WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.690
Now we move from quality to variable meaning
Measurement scale tells

00:00:05.716 --> 00:00:11.500
us which comparisons and arithmetic operations are
defensible Nominal

00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:18.835
and ordinal are categorical scales Interval and
ratio are numeric scales The

00:00:18.862 --> 00:00:24.164
key questions are whether order exists whether
differences have a consistent meaning and whether
zero

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:26.559
represents the absence of the measured quantity
